WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.410
Final whistle.

2
00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:04.210
Your team has just lost the cup final.

3
00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:07.730
You're gutted all evening
and grumpy the next day.

4
00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:10.690
By the weekend, you're
laughing with your mates again.

5
00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:13.080
Your teammate lost the same match.

6
00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:14.980
But their cloud stays.

7
00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.280
Weeks pass.

8
00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:19.710
They're tired, picking
at meals, lying awake,

9
00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:21.850
not even enjoying football.

10
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.140
Everyone feels sad sometimes.

11
00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.820
So when does a doctor
stop calling it sadness,

12
00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:29.080
and start calling it depression?

13
00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.140
In this mission, you'll
see that sadness is normal,

14
00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:33.650
and it lifts.

15
00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:38.290
Then you'll meet the symptoms doctors
look for in a system called ICD.

16
00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:42.060
Depression is more than low
mood: think reduced energy,

17
00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:44.560
and changes in sleep and appetite.

18
00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:48.120
Your mission: find out where
a doctor draws the line.
